Package: vabaxos-news
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gir1.2-gstreamer-1.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-libav
Description: News and podcasts, read and played from the keyboard
 The news sites and podcasts you choose (RSS and Atom; a site's address is
 enough, its feed is found), newest first. A news item opens its summary
 and the browser; a podcast episode plays, with keys to pause, jump 30
 seconds and change the speed from 1 to 2 times.
